  "description": "Ji-ha, the weakest labor-class hunter with neither skill nor fighting ability, made a living by running a store while holding the lowest hunter rank.\n\nBut one day, his life as a hunter changed when he entered a garden from a different dimension through his dream...\n\n<You have obtained Friendly Plant Lv.1> <You have obtained Blessing of XXX Lv.1>\n\n'I gained a skill just by planting one twig...?'\n\nHis unique adventure as the sole gardener in the hunter world begins.",
